---
const notFit = [
  "You want a logo, a brochure site, or social media posts.",
  "You want the cheapest possible hourly rate.",
  "Nobody on your side can answer questions about how the work actually runs.",
];
---

<section class="section about" id="about">
  <div class="wrap about__grid">
    <div class="about__media" data-reveal>
      <!-- Replace the contents of .portrait with <img src="/portrait.jpg" alt="Renz Rodney Ramido" /> -->
      <div class="portrait">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 400 400" aria-hidden="true">
          <g stroke="#1e2a4a" stroke-width="1">
            <path d="M0 100 H400 M0 200 H400 M0 300 H400 M100 0 V400 M200 0 V400 M300 0 V400"></path>
          </g>
          <text x="200" y="215" text-anchor="middle" class="portrait__mark">R4</text>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <p class="portrait__cap">Renz Rodney Ramido, operator</p>
    </div>

    <div class="about__body">
      <h2 data-reveal>About</h2>

      <p class="lede" data-reveal style="--delay:100ms">
        I am Renz Rodney Ramido. R4 Systems is me, and that is deliberate. You talk to the person
        who builds the thing, so nothing is lost between a sales call and the work.
      </p>

      <p class="lede" data-reveal style="--delay:160ms">
        My background is operations before it was automation. I ran a business, handled the money,
        the staffing, and the days when it did not go to plan. That is why I start with where your
        work actually breaks rather than with a piece of software. The build comes second.
      </p>

      <p class="lede" data-reveal style="--delay:220ms">
        I design and ship using AI-assisted development, which is why a system that used to take
        months takes days. This website is an example of it. Every decision on this page is one I
        can explain.
      </p>

      <ul class="creds" data-reveal style="--delay:280ms">
        <li>Bachelor of Science in Information Technology</li>
        <li>AI Automation and Technical Operations Consultant</li>
      </ul>

      <div class="about__cta" data-reveal style="--delay:320ms">
        <a class="btn" href="/Renz-Rodney-Ramido-CV.pdf" download>Download CV</a>
        <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="#contact">Send an email</a>
      </div>

      <aside class="fit" data-reveal style="--delay:380ms">
        <h3>Probably not a fit if</h3>
        <ul>
          {notFit.map((n) => <li>{n}</li>)}
        </ul>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    background: var(--haze);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .about__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.7fr) minmax(0, 1.3fr);
    gap: clamp(32px, 5vw, 80px);
  }

  .about__media {
    position: sticky;
    top: 130px;
  }

  .portrait {
    aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
    background: var(--navy);
    border-radius: 6px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .portrait :global(img) {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .portrait svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }

  .portrait__mark {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 96px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    fill: #fff;
  }

  .portrait__cap {
    margin-top: 14px;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--mute);
  }

  .about__body {
    display: grid;
    gap: 20px;
    justify-items: start;
  }

  .creds {
    display: grid;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-top: 6px;
  }

  .creds li {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--ink-2);
    padding-left: 16px;
    position: relative;
  }

  .creds li::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0.62em;
    width: 6px;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--blue);
  }

  .about__cta {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }

  .fit {
    margin-top: 18px;
    padding: 26px 28px;
    background: var(--paper);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 6px;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .fit h3 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .fit ul {
    display: grid;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .fit li {
    font-size: 0.94rem;
    color: var(--mute);
    padding-left: 20px;
    position: relative;
  }

  .fit li::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0.6em;
    width: 9px;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--line-strong);
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .about__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .about__media {
      position: static;
      max-width: 280px;
    }
  }
</style>
